{"slug":"Universal-Script-Anti-Logger-MITM-85050","_id":"6965717a00b38dacb86cc966","title":"Anti Logger MITM","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":"/images/sb/0-1768298155675.png","placeId":0},"features":"To whitelist a specific webhook, u need to whitelist the number in the webhook e.g\nwebhooks/1457063196112039900000\n\nExample:\ngetfenv().whitelist= {\n\"1457063196112039900000\",\n}\nOr the long string, if u can copy it.\nu can see the url in the dev console, or use tools to copy text from image and whitelist whatever u want.\n\nDon't whitelist short letters e.g. \"a\", u are whitelisting everything that has the letter \"a\".\n\n\nExplanation for none developers:\n\nRun this before any other script. It acts as a shield by:\n\n• Spoofing your IP: It generates a fake, random IP address so loggers can't find your real location.\n\n• Hiding Private Data: It replaces sensitive info like your city, ISP, and zip code with the word \"VOID\".\n\n• Blocking Webhooks: It stops scripts from sending your data to Discord servers.\n\n• Safety: Even if a script logs your info, it only gets the \"junk\" data and fake IP, keeping your real identity safe.\n\nversion 1.1\nCredit: depso","tags":["Anti Logger","IP Logger Detector","Anti IP Logger","MITM"],"script":"getfenv().Custom_Blacklist = {\n    -- \"https://hi.com\"\n} \n\ngetfenv().whitelist = {}\ngetfenv()._blockwebhook = true\ngetfenv().DEBUG = true\n\nloadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/VoidShell-null/VoidShell-Hub/refs/heads/main/Scripts/Anti_Logger.luau\"))()","owner":{"_id":"6786346b9b072baee98122e5","username":"NullSpecter","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/6786346b9b072baee98122e5-1758723937551.png","status":"offline","id":"6786346b9b072baee98122e5","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000}},"verified":false,"discord":"https://discord.gg/U2nvFRa8zQ","views":1846,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":f